cards.body:
Be careful when someone:

- asks you to **pay a fee** to get work or join a team;
- **overpays** and asks you to send the extra back;
- wants a **large amount of unpaid work** as a test;
- pushes you to move **off a freelancing platform** quickly to avoid its protections;
- sends **links or files** asking for your login details.

Keep work and payment on agreed, traceable methods, and check the current rules of any platform you use.
